<!doctype html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>BIST Tarama Bulteni - {{ as_of_date }}</title>
<style>
  /* ========== TEMEL ========== */
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin:0; padding:0; background:#f9fafb;
    font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
    color:#1f2937; line-height:1.6; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    font-size:14px;
  }
  .wrap { max-width:860px; margin:0 auto; padding:28px 20px; }

  /* ========== KARTLAR ========== */
  .card {
    background:#fff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px;
    padding:28px; margin-bottom:20px;
    box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(15,23,42,0.04);
  }

  /* ========== HERO ========== */
  .hero {
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a 0%,#1e3a8a 100%);
    color:#fff; border-radius:14px; padding:32px 28px; margin-bottom:20px;
    box-shadow:0 8px 24px -8px rgba(15,23,42,0.3);
  }
  .hero h1 { font-size:22px; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 6px; letter-spacing:-0.02em; }
  .hero .date { font-size:12px; color:#93c5fd; font-weight:600; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.06em; margin-bottom:14px; }
  .hero .headline { font-size:14px; color:#e0e7ff; line-height:1.65; margin:0; }

  .pillrow { margin-top:18px; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; }
  .pill {
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    color:#fff; border-radius:6px; padding:5px 11px;
    font-size:11.5px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.02em;
  }
  .pill.alert { background:rgba(239,68,68,0.18); border-color:rgba(239,68,68,0.35); color:#fca5a5; }

  /* ========== BOLUM BASLIKLARI ========== */
  .section-title {
    font-size:17px; font-weight:800; color:#0f172a;
    margin:0 0 4px; letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
  }
  .section-title::before {
    content:''; display:inline-block; width:3px; height:16px;
    background:#1e40af; border-radius:2px;
  }
  .section-sub { font-size:12.5px; color:#6b7280; margin:0 0 20px; padding-left:11px; }

  /* ========== DURUM BADGE ========== */
  .badge {
    display:inline-block; border-radius:5px; padding:3px 8px;
    font-size:9.5px; font-weight:800; text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:0.05em; vertical-align:middle; white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .badge-STRONG_OPPORTUNITY { background:#d1fae5; color:#065f46; }
  .badge-OPPORTUNITY        { background:#dbeafe; color:#1e40af; }
  .badge-WATCHLIST          { background:#fef3c7; color:#92400e; }
  .badge-NO_ACTION          { background:#f1f5f9; color:#475569; }
  .badge-QUARANTINE         { background:#fee2e2; color:#991b1b; }

  /* ========== OZET TABLO ========== */
  .table-container {
    overflow-x:auto; margin:0 0 16px;
    border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px;
  }
  .summary-table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:13px; }
  .summary-table thead th {
    background:#f8fafc; color:#475569;
    font-weight:700; font-size:10.5px;
    text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.04em;
    padding:11px 14px; border-bottom:2px solid #e2e8f0;
    text-align:left; white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .summary-table tbody td {
    padding:11px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;
    color:#1e293b; vertical-align:middle;
  }
  .summary-table tbody tr:hover { background:#f8fafc; }
  .summary-table tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom:none; }

  .summary-table .col-ticker { font-weight:800; font-size:13.5px; color:#0f172a; white-space:nowrap; }
  .summary-table .col-num    { text-align:right; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; }
  .summary-table .col-roi    { text-align:right; font-weight:700; color:#059669; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; }
  .summary-table .col-stop   { text-align:right; font-weight:700; color:#dc2626; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; }
  .summary-table .col-dcf    { text-align:right; color:#64748b; font-size:12px; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; white-space:nowrap; }

  /* ========== AKORDIYON ========== */
  details.section-details {
    margin-top:4px;
    border:1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius:10px;
    background:#f8fafc; overflow:hidden;
  }
  details.section-details > summary {
    cursor:pointer; list-style:none;
    padding:13px 18px;
    font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b;
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    user-select:none;
    transition:background 0.15s;
  }
  details.section-details > summary::-webkit-details-marker { display:none; }
  details.section-details > summary::before {
    content:'+'; display:inline-block;
    width:16px; height:16px; line-height:15px; text-align:center;
    font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:#64748b;
    border:1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius:4px; background:#fff;
  }
  details.section-details[open] > summary::before { content:'−'; }
  details.section-details > summary:hover { background:#f1f5f9; }
  details.section-details > .details-body { padding:0 18px 18px; background:#fff; border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0; }

  /* ========== KOPYALA KUTUSU ========== */
  .quick-copy-box {
    background:#0f172a; color:#e2e8f0;
    border-radius:8px; padding:14px 16px; margin-top:16px;
    font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,monospace;
    font-size:11.5px; line-height:1.8;
    white-space:pre-wrap; overflow-x:auto;
  }

  /* ========== DETAY KARTI ========== */
  .detail-card {
    background:#fff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px;
    padding:0; margin:16px 0;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .detail-card + .detail-card { margin-top:14px; }

  .detail-header {
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap;
    padding:16px 20px; background:#f8fafc;
    border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;
  }
  .detail-header .left { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; }
  .detail-num {
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    min-width:26px; height:26px; padding:0 8px;
    background:#1e40af; color:#fff;
    font-size:11px; font-weight:800; border-radius:6px;
    font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;
  }
  .detail-header .ticker { font-size:18px; font-weight:800; color:#0f172a; letter-spacing:0.02em; }

  .detail-body { padding:20px; }

  /* Fiyat Kutulari */
  .price-row {
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(110px, 1fr));
    gap:0; margin:0 0 18px;
    background:#f8fafc; border-radius:8px;
    border:1px solid #f1f5f9; padding:14px;
  }
  .price-box {
    padding:0 16px; border-right:1px solid #e2e8f0;
  }
  .price-box:first-child { padding-left:0; }
  .price-box:last-child { border-right:none; padding-right:0; }
  .price-box .lbl {
    font-size:10px; color:#64748b; font-weight:700;
    text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.06em;
    margin-bottom:4px;
  }
  .price-box .val {
    font-size:19px; font-weight:800; color:#0f172a;
    line-height:1.2; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;
  }
  .price-box .val.up   { color:#059669; }
  .price-box .val.down { color:#dc2626; }
  .price-box .live-tag { font-size:10px; color:#94a3b8; font-weight:500; margin-top:3px; }

  /* Neden / Risk */
  .insight-box { margin-bottom:16px; }
  .why, .risk {
    padding:14px 16px; border-radius:6px;
    font-size:13px; line-height:1.6;
    margin-bottom:10px;
  }
  .why  { color:#334155; background:#f0f9ff; border-left:3px solid #3b82f6; }
  .risk { color:#7f1d1d; background:#fef2f2; border-left:3px solid #ef4444; margin-bottom:0; }
  .why b, .risk b { color:#0f172a; font-weight:700; }

  /* Uyari kutusu (Sloan) */
  .flag-warning {
    margin-top:12px; padding:10px 14px;
    background:#fef2f2; border:1px solid #fecaca;
    border-radius:6px; color:#991b1b; font-size:12px;
  }

  /* Metrik Tablosu */
  .metric-table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:12.5px; margin:16px 0 8px; }
  .metric-table tbody tr { border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9; }
  .metric-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background:#fafbfc; }
  .metric-table tbody tr:last-child { border-bottom:none; }
  .metric-table td {
    padding:9px 4px; color:#334155; vertical-align:middle;
  }
  .metric-table td:first-child {
    color:#64748b; font-size:12px; width:60%;
  }
  .metric-table td:last-child {
    text-align:right; font-weight:600; color:#1f2937;
    font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;
  }
  .metric-table td.highlight { color:#059669; }
  .metric-table td.risk { color:#dc2626; }

  /* Deneysel Kutular */
  .exp-box {
    border:1px dashed #cbd5e1; border-radius:8px;
    padding:14px 16px; margin-top:12px;
    background:#f8fafc; font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.6;
  }
  .exp-box .exp-title {
    font-weight:700; color:#0f172a; font-size:12px;
    margin-bottom:4px;
  }

  /* Kucuk notlar */
  .note-inline { font-size:12px; color:#64748b; margin-top:12px; line-height:1.6; }
  .note-inline .highlight { color:#0f172a; font-weight:700; }
  .invalidation-box {
    margin:14px 0; padding:10px 14px;
    background:#f8fafc; border-radius:6px;
    font-size:12px; color:#475569;
  }

  /* ========== GENEL YARDIMCI ========== */
  .muted    { color:#64748b; }
  .small    { font-size:12px; color:#64748b; line-height:1.6; }
  .highlight{ font-weight:700; color:#0f172a; }
  .empty-note {
    padding:28px; text-align:center;
    background:#f8fafc; border:1px dashed #e2e8f0;
    border-radius:8px; color:#94a3b8; font-size:13px;
  }

  ul.plain { margin:12px 0; padding-left:18px; color:#475569; font-size:12.5px; }
  ul.plain li { margin-bottom:5px; }

  /* Uyari karti (Yogunlasma) */
  .warn-box {
    padding:12px 16px; background:#fffbeb;
    border-left:3px solid #f59e0b; border-radius:6px;
    margin-top:14px;
  }
  .warn-box .wt { color:#b45309; font-weight:700; font-size:12.5px; }
  .warn-box ul { margin:6px 0 0; padding-left:18px; color:#92400e; font-size:12px; }

  /* Bozulan tezler */
  .broken-list { list-style:none; padding:0; margin:0; }
  .broken-list li {
    padding:12px 16px; background:#fef2f2;
    border:1px solid #fee2e2; border-left:3px solid #ef4444;
    border-radius:6px; margin-bottom:8px;
    color:#7f1d1d; font-size:12.5px;
  }

  /* Gecmis Tahmin Tablosu */
  .eval-table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:12.5px; margin-top:8px; }
  .eval-table th {
    text-align:left; padding:10px 12px;
    background:#f8fafc; color:#64748b;
    font-size:10.5px; font-weight:700;
    text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.04em;
    border-bottom:2px solid #e2e8f0;
  }
  .eval-table td {
    padding:10px 12px; border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9; color:#334155;
  }
  .eval-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom:none; }

  /* Filtre listesi */
  .filter-list { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:12px; }
  .filter-list th {
    text-align:left; padding:8px 10px;
    color:#64748b; font-size:10.5px; font-weight:700;
    text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.04em;
    border-bottom:2px solid #e2e8f0; background:#f8fafc;
  }
  .filter-list td {
    padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9; color:#334155;
  }
  .filter-list tr:last-child td { border-bottom:none; }

  /* Footer */
  .footer {
    font-size:11px; color:#94a3b8; line-height:1.75;
    padding:0 12px; text-align:justify; margin-top:12px;
  }
  .footer p { margin:8px 0; }
  .footer .divider {
    border-top:1px solid #cbd5e1;
    margin:16px 0 12px; width:40px;
  }

  /* ========== MOBIL ========== */
  @media (max-width:640px) {
    .wrap { padding:14px; }
    .card, .hero { padding:20px; }
    .hero h1 { font-size:19px; }
    .detail-body { padding:16px; }

    /* Fiyat kutulari 2x2 grid */
    .price-row {
      grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
      gap:10px; padding:0; background:transparent; border:none;
    }
    .price-box {
      border-right:none; padding:12px;
      background:#f8fafc; border:1px solid #f1f5f9; border-radius:8px;
    }
    .price-box:first-child { padding-left:12px; }

    /* Metrik tablolari mobilde blok haline gelsin */
    .metric-table, .metric-table tbody, .metric-table tr, .metric-table td { display:block; width:100%; }
    .metric-table td { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:7px 0; }
    .metric-table td:first-child { width:auto; color:#64748b; }
    .metric-table td:last-child { width:auto; text-align:right; }
    .metric-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background:transparent; }
    .metric-table tbody tr { border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9; }

    /* Summary-table yatay kaydirmali kalsin */
    .summary-table { min-width:540px; }
    .table-container { border-radius:8px; }

    /* Eval ve filtre tablolarini blok yap */
    .eval-table, .eval-table tbody, .eval-table tr, .eval-table td { display:block; width:100%; }
    .eval-table thead { display:none; }
    .eval-table td { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:8px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9; }
    .eval-table td:before { content:attr(data-label); font-weight:600; color:#64748b; font-size:11px; text-transform:uppercase; }

    .filter-list, .filter-list tbody, .filter-list tr, .filter-list td { display:block; width:100%; }
    .filter-list thead { display:none; }
    .filter-list td { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:8px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9; }
    .filter-list td:before { content:attr(data-label); font-weight:600; color:#64748b; font-size:11px; text-transform:uppercase; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <!-- ============================== 1. HERO ============================== -->
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>BIST Tarama Bulteni</h1>
    <div class="date">{{ as_of_date }}</div>
    <div class="headline">
      {% if no_action_today %}
        Bugun hard-filter'lardan gecen bir aday yok — sistem bilerek sessiz kaliyor, aksiyon onerilmiyor.
      {% elif regime_taxonomy_tag %}
        Rejim: <span style="color:#ffffff; font-weight:700;">{{ regime_taxonomy_tag }}</span>. Asagida kisa ve uzun vade adaylarin ozeti yer alir; her hissenin detayli tezi "Aday Bazli Detaylar" bolumundedir.
      {% else %}
        Asagida kisa ve uzun vade adaylarin ozeti yer alir; her hissenin detayli tezi "Aday Bazli Detaylar" bolumundedir.
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    {% if regime %}
    <div class="pillrow">
      <span class="pill">Faiz %{{ regime.policy_rate_pct | fmt }}</span>
      <span class="pill">2Y Tahvil %{{ regime.bond_2y_pct | fmt }}</span>
      <span class="pill">TUFE %{{ regime.cpi_yoy_pct | fmt }}</span>
      <span class="pill">USD/TRY {{ regime.usdtry_spot | fmt }}</span>
      <span class="pill">XU100 {{ regime.xu100_level | fmt }}</span>
      {% if regime.short_selling_ban_active %}<span class="pill alert">Aciga Satis Yasagi Aktif</span>{% endif %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  {% set price_source_label = {'live': 'Anlik', 'vwap_fallback': 'Hacim Ort. (VWAP)', 'last_close': 'Kapanis'} %}

  <!-- ============================== 2. UZUN VADE ============================== -->
  <div class="card">
    <h2 class="section-title">Uzun Vade Onerileri</h2>
    <div class="section-sub">~6 aylik ufuk · sektor ici goreli degerlemeye dayali hedef fiyat hesabi</div>

    {% if long_term_candidates %}
    <div class="table-container">
      <table class="summary-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Hisse</th>
            <th class="col-num">Alis (Guncel)</th>
            <th class="col-num">Hedef</th>
            <th class="col-roi">Getiri</th>
            <th class="col-stop">Stop-Loss</th>
            <th class="col-dcf">Adil Deger / DCF</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for c in long_term_candidates %}
          <tr>
            <td class="col-ticker">
              {{ c.ticker }}
              <span class="badge badge-{{ c.candidate_state }}">{{ c.candidate_state }}</span>
            </td>
            <td class="col-num">{{ c.current_price | fmt }}</td>
            <td class="col-num" style="font-weight:700; color:#0f172a;">{{ c.target_price | fmt }}</td>
            <td class="col-roi">%{{ c.expected_roi_pct | fmt }}</td>
            <td class="col-stop">{{ c.stop_loss | fmt }}</td>
            <td class="col-dcf">
              {% if c.fair_value_low is not none and c.fair_value_high is not none %}
                {{ c.fair_value_low | fmt }} – {{ c.fair_value_high | fmt }}
              {% elif c.dcf and c.dcf.fair_value_low is not none and not c.dcf.null_reason %}
                {{ c.dcf.fair_value_low | fmt }} – {{ c.dcf.fair_value_high | fmt }}
              {% elif c.gordon and c.gordon.fair_value_low is not none and not c.gordon.null_reason %}
                {{ c.gordon.fair_value_low | fmt }} – {{ c.gordon.fair_value_high | fmt }} <span class="muted">(G)</span>
              {% else %}
                <span class="muted">—</span>
              {% endif %}
            </td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <details class="section-details">
      <summary>Aday Bazli Detaylar ve Kopyala Metni ({{ long_term_candidates | length }} hisse)</summary>
      <div class="details-body">

        <details style="margin-top:16px;">
          <summary style="cursor:pointer; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; color:#475569; padding:8px 0;">Hizli Kopyala (Metin Formati)</summary>
          <div class="quick-copy-box">{%- for c in long_term_candidates %}
* {{ c.ticker }} | Alis: {{ c.current_price | fmt }} → Hedef: {{ c.target_price | fmt }} (%{{ c.expected_roi_pct | fmt }}){% if c.fair_value_low is not none %} | Adil Deger: {{ c.fair_value_low | fmt }} - {{ c.fair_value_high | fmt }}{% elif c.dcf and c.dcf.fair_value_low is not none and not c.dcf.null_reason %} | DCF: {{ c.dcf.fair_value_low | fmt }} - {{ c.dcf.fair_value_high | fmt }}{% endif %}{% if c.stop_loss is not none %} | Stop: {{ c.stop_loss | fmt }}{% endif %}{% if c.position_size_pct is not none %} | Poz: %{{ c.position_size_pct | fmt }}{% endif %}{%- endfor %}</div>
        </details>

        {% for c in long_term_candidates %}
        <div class="detail-card">
          <div class="detail-header">
            <div class="left">
              <span class="detail-num">{{ loop.index }}</span>
              <span class="ticker">{{ c.ticker }}</span>
            </div>
            <span class="badge badge-{{ c.candidate_state }}">{{ c.candidate_state }}</span>
          </div>

          <div class="detail-body">

            <div class="price-row">
              <div class="price-box">
                <div class="lbl">Guncel</div>
                <div class="val">{{ c.current_price | fmt }}</div>
                <div class="live-tag">{{ price_source_label.get(c.price_source, c.price_source) }}</div>
              </div>
              <div class="price-box">
                <div class="lbl">Hedef</div>
                <div class="val up">{{ c.target_price | fmt }}</div>
              </div>
              <div class="price-box">
                <div class="lbl">Beklenen Getiri</div>
                <div class="val up">%{{ c.expected_roi_pct | fmt }}</div>
              </div>
              {% if c.stop_loss is not none %}
              <div class="price-box">
                <div class="lbl">Stop-Loss</div>
                <div class="val down">{{ c.stop_loss | fmt }}</div>
              </div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>

            <div class="insight-box">
              <div class="why"><b>Neden:</b> {{ c.why_now }}</div>
              <div class="risk"><b>Ana Risk:</b> {{ c.main_risk }}</div>
            </div>

            {% if c.upcoming_events %}
            <div class="note-inline">
              <span class="highlight">Yaklasan Olaylar:</span>
              {% for ev in c.upcoming_events %}{{ ev.event_type }} ({{ ev.event_date }}){% if not loop.last %}; {% endif %}{% endfor %}
            </div>
            {% endif %}

            <ul class="plain">{% for b in c.thesis_bullets %}<li>{{ b }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>

            <div class="invalidation-box">
              <span class="highlight">Bozulma Kosulu:</span> {{ c.invalidation_condition_display }}
            </div>

            <table class="metric-table">
              <tbody>
                <tr><td>Giris fiyati</td><td>{{ c.entry_price | fmt }}</td></tr>
                {% if c.entry_low is not none and c.entry_high is not none %}
                <tr><td>Kademeli Alis Bandi</td><td>{{ c.entry_low | fmt }} – {{ c.entry_high | fmt }}</td></tr>
                {% endif %}
                {% if c.stop_loss is not none %}
                <tr><td>Dinamik Stop-Loss</td><td class="risk">{{ c.stop_loss | fmt }}</td></tr>
                {% endif %}
                {% if c.position_size_pct is not none %}
                <tr><td>Onerilen Pozisyon Buyuklugu</td><td>%{{ c.position_size_pct | fmt }}</td></tr>
                {% endif %}
                {% if c.fair_value_base is not none %}
                <tr><td>Adil Deger Bandi (Ucgen)</td><td class="highlight">{{ c.fair_value_low | fmt }} – {{ c.fair_value_high | fmt }} <span class="muted">(Baz: {{ c.fair_value_base | fmt }})</span></td></tr>
                {% endif %}
                {% if c.valuation_method %}
                <tr><td>Degerleme Metodu</td><td>{{ c.valuation_method }}</td></tr>
                {% endif %}
                <tr><td>Hurdle orani</td><td>%{{ c.hurdle_rate_pct | fmt }}</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Hurdle uzeri fazla getiri</td><td class="highlight">%{{ c.excess_over_hurdle_pct | fmt }}</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Beta-duzeltmeli fazla</td><td>%{{ c.excess_over_beta_hurdle_pct | fmt }}</td></tr>
                <tr><td>F-Score (Normalize)</td><td>{{ c.piotroski_normalized_score | fmt }}</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Esler grubu</td><td>{{ c.peer_group_used }} (n={{ c.peer_n }})</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Guven duzeyi</td><td>{{ c.confidence }}</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Raporlama bazi</td><td>{{ c.reporting_basis }}</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Tedbir seviyesi</td><td>{{ c.tedbir_level | fmt }}</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Perakende payi</td><td>%{{ c.retail_pct | fmt }}</td></tr>
                {% if c.net_expected_roi_pct is not none %}
                <tr><td>Net Getiri (Maliyet Sonrasi)</td><td class="highlight">%{{ c.net_expected_roi_pct | fmt }} <span class="muted">(Maliyet: %{{ c.transaction_cost_pct | fmt }})</span></td></tr>
                {% endif %}
              </tbody>
            </table>

            {% if c.sloan_flag %}
            <div class="flag-warning">
              <b>Uyari:</b> elevated_earnings_quality_risk (peer_percentile: {{ c.sloan_peer_percentile | fmt }})
            </div>
            {% endif %}

            <div class="note-inline">FCF getirisi (USD bazli, bilgi amacli): <b>%{{ c.fcf_yield_usd | fmt }}</b></div>

            {% if c.gordon %}
            <div class="exp-box">
              <div class="exp-title">Gordon Buyume Referansi <span class="muted" style="font-weight:400;">(deneysel, ana karara girmez)</span></div>
              {% if c.gordon.null_reason %}
                <span class="muted">Hesaplanamadi: {{ c.gordon.null_reason }}</span>
              {% else %}
                Adil deger araligi: <b>{{ c.gordon.fair_value_low | fmt }} – {{ c.gordon.fair_value_high | fmt }}</b>
                <span class="muted">(Iskonto: %{{ c.gordon.discount_rate_low | fmt }} / %{{ c.gordon.discount_rate_base | fmt }} / %{{ c.gordon.discount_rate_high | fmt }})</span>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if c.dcf %}
            <div class="exp-box">
              <div class="exp-title">DCF Referansi <span class="muted" style="font-weight:400;">(deneysel, ana karara girmez)</span></div>
              {% if c.dcf.null_reason %}
                <span class="muted">Hesaplanamadi: {{ c.dcf.null_reason }}</span>
              {% else %}
                Adil deger araligi: <b>{{ c.dcf.fair_value_low | fmt }} – {{ c.dcf.fair_value_high | fmt }}</b>
                <span class="muted">(mevcut fiyata gore %{{ c.dcf.premium_discount_low_pct | fmt }} / %{{ c.dcf.premium_discount_high_pct | fmt }})</span><br>
                <span class="muted">WACC: %{{ c.dcf.wacc_pct | fmt }} · terminal buyume: %{{ c.dcf.terminal_growth_pct | fmt }}</span>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
            {% endif %}

          </div>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}

      </div>
    </details>
    {% else %}
    <div class="empty-note">Bugun icin uzun vade adayi bulunmuyor.</div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <!-- ============================== 3. KISA VADE ============================== -->
  <div class="card">
    <h2 class="section-title">Kisa Vade Onerileri</h2>
    <div class="section-sub">~20 gunluk ufuk · hacim teyitli teknik kirilim · "Giris" 20 gunluk ortalamaya cekilme bazalidir</div>

    {% if short_term_candidates %}
    <div class="table-container">
      <table class="summary-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Hisse</th>
            <th class="col-num">Giris</th>
            <th class="col-num">Hedef (ATR)</th>
            <th class="col-roi">Getiri</th>
            <th class="col-stop">Stop-Loss</th>
            <th class="col-num">Mevcut</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for c in short_term_candidates %}
          <tr>
            <td class="col-ticker">
              {{ c.ticker }}
              <span class="badge badge-{{ c.candidate_state }}">{{ c.candidate_state }}</span>
            </td>
            <td class="col-num">{{ c.entry_price | fmt }}</td>
            <td class="col-num" style="font-weight:700; color:#0f172a;">{{ c.target_price | fmt }}</td>
            <td class="col-roi">%{{ c.expected_roi_pct | fmt }}</td>
            <td class="col-stop">{{ c.stop_loss | fmt }}</td>
            <td class="col-num">{{ c.current_price | fmt }}</td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <details class="section-details">
      <summary>Aday Bazli Detaylar ve Kopyala Metni ({{ short_term_candidates | length }} hisse)</summary>
      <div class="details-body">

        <details style="margin-top:16px;">
          <summary style="cursor:pointer; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; color:#475569; padding:8px 0;">Hizli Kopyala (Metin Formati)</summary>
          <div class="quick-copy-box">{%- for c in short_term_candidates %}
* {{ c.ticker }} | Alis: {{ c.entry_price | fmt }}{% if c.entry_low is not none %} (Bant: {{ c.entry_low | fmt }}-{{ c.entry_high | fmt }}){% endif %} | Hedef: {{ c.target_price | fmt }} (%{{ c.expected_roi_pct | fmt }}) | Stop: {{ c.stop_loss | fmt }}{% if c.position_size_pct is not none %} | Poz: %{{ c.position_size_pct | fmt }}{% endif %} | Mevcut: {{ c.current_price | fmt }}{%- endfor %}</div>
        </details>

        {% for c in short_term_candidates %}
        <div class="detail-card">
          <div class="detail-header">
            <div class="left">
              <span class="detail-num">{{ loop.index }}</span>
              <span class="ticker">{{ c.ticker }}</span>
            </div>
            <span class="badge badge-{{ c.candidate_state }}">{{ c.candidate_state }}</span>
          </div>

          <div class="detail-body">

            <div class="price-row">
              <div class="price-box">
                <div class="lbl">Guncel</div>
                <div class="val">{{ c.current_price | fmt }}</div>
                <div class="live-tag">{{ price_source_label.get(c.price_source, c.price_source) }}</div>
              </div>
              <div class="price-box">
                <div class="lbl">Giris (Pullback)</div>
                <div class="val">{{ c.entry_price | fmt }}</div>
              </div>
              <div class="price-box">
                <div class="lbl">ATR Hedefi</div>
                <div class="val up">{{ c.target_price | fmt }}</div>
              </div>
              <div class="price-box">
                <div class="lbl">Stop-Loss</div>
                <div class="val down">{{ c.stop_loss | fmt }}</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <table class="metric-table">
              <tbody>
                {% if c.entry_low is not none and c.entry_high is not none %}
                <tr><td>Kademeli Alis Bandi</td><td>{{ c.entry_low | fmt }} – {{ c.entry_high | fmt }}</td></tr>
                {% endif %}
                {% if c.position_size_pct is not none %}
                <tr><td>Onerilen Pozisyon Buyuklugu</td><td>%{{ c.position_size_pct | fmt }}</td></tr>
                {% endif %}
                <tr><td>Hacim teyidi (20g orani)</td><td>{{ c.volume_ratio_20d | fmt }}</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Hurdle orani</td><td>%{{ c.hurdle_rate_pct | fmt }}</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Hurdle uzeri fazla</td><td class="highlight">%{{ c.excess_over_hurdle_pct | fmt }}</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Katalizor skoru</td><td>{{ c.catalyst_score | fmt }}</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Guven duzeyi</td><td>{{ c.confidence }}</td></tr>
                {% if c.net_expected_roi_pct is not none %}
                <tr><td>Net Getiri (Maliyet Sonrasi)</td><td class="highlight">%{{ c.net_expected_roi_pct | fmt }} <span class="muted">(Maliyet: %{{ c.transaction_cost_pct | fmt }})</span></td></tr>
                {% endif %}
              </tbody>
            </table>

          </div>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}

      </div>
    </details>
    {% else %}
    <div class="empty-note">Bugun icin kisa vade adayi bulunmuyor.</div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <!-- ============================== 4. GUNLUK DEGISIMLER ============================== -->
  {% if decision_diff.entered or decision_diff.exited or decision_diff.catalyst_deltas or decision_diff.macro_deltas or concentration_warnings %}
  <div class="card">
    <h2 class="section-title">Gunluk Degisimler</h2>

    <div style="margin-top:16px;">
      {% if decision_diff.entered %}
      <div class="small" style="margin-bottom:6px;"><span class="highlight">Portfoye Yeni Giren:</span> {{ decision_diff.entered | join(', ') }}</div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if decision_diff.exited %}
      <div class="small" style="margin-bottom:6px;"><span class="highlight">Portfoyden Cikan:</span> {{ decision_diff.exited | join(', ') }}</div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if decision_diff.catalyst_deltas %}
      <div class="small" style="margin-top:12px;"><span class="highlight">Yeni KAP Olaylari:</span><br>
        {% for e in decision_diff.catalyst_deltas %}&bull; {{ e.ticker }} ({{ e.category }} : {{ e.published_at }}){% if not loop.last %}<br>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if decision_diff.macro_deltas %}
      <div class="small" style="margin-top:12px;"><span class="highlight">Makro Degisim:</span>
        {% for m in decision_diff.macro_deltas %}{{ m.field }}: {{ m.from | fmt }} → {{ m.to | fmt }}{% if not loop.last %}; {% endif %}{% endfor %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if concentration_warnings %}
      <div class="warn-box">
        <div class="wt">Yogunlasma Uyarilari</div>
        <ul>
          {% for w in concentration_warnings %}<li>{{ w.message }}</li>{% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ============================== 5. BOZULAN TEZLER ============================== -->
  {% if invalidation_triggered %}
  <div class="card">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="color:#991b1b;">Bozulan Tezler</h2>
    <div class="section-sub">Asagidakiler dogrudan bir SATIS SINYALI degildir — portfoy izleme bildirimidir.</div>

    <ul class="broken-list">
      {% for t in invalidation_triggered %}
      <li>
        <b>{{ t.ticker }}</b>: {{ t.condition_field }} {{ t.condition_operator }} {{ t.condition_value }} kosulu tetiklendi (Guncel: {{ t.current_value }})
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ============================== 6. GECMIS TAHMIN ============================== -->
  {% if evaluation_summary %}
  <div class="card">
    <h2 class="section-title">Gecmis Tahmin Izleme Ozeti</h2>
    <div class="section-sub">Canli takip ozeti (Backtest degildir). Gecmis performans gelecegi garanti etmez. {{ evaluation_summary.independence_caveat }}</div>

    <table class="eval-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Ufuk (Gun)</th>
          <th>Gozlem</th>
          <th>Isabet</th>
          <th>Medyan Fazla Getiri</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
      {% for horizon, s in evaluation_summary.by_horizon.items() %}
        {% if s %}
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Ufuk">{{ horizon }}</td>
          <td data-label="Gozlem Sayisi">{{ s.n_observations | fmt }}</td>
          <td data-label="Isabet Orani" class="highlight">%{{ s.hit_rate_pct | fmt }}</td>
          <td data-label="Fazla Getiri">%{{ s.median_excess_vs_index | fmt }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ============================== 7. FILTREYE TAKILANLAR ============================== -->
  <div class="card">
    <details style="border:none;">
      <summary style="cursor:pointer; font-size:14px; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; padding:4px 0;">
        Filtreye takilan / Skorlanamayan Hisseler ({{ no_action_count | fmt }} + {{ unscored_count | fmt }})
      </summary>
      <div class="small" style="margin:12px 0 16px;">{{ unscored_count }} adet hisse bu kosuda skorlanamadi (eksik veri, baz belirsizligi veya yetersiz esler grubu).</div>

      {% if filtered_candidates %}
      <table class="filter-list">
        <thead><tr><th>Ticker</th><th>Filtrelenme Nedeni</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for c in filtered_candidates %}
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Ticker" class="highlight">{{ c.ticker }}</td>
            <td data-label="Neden">{{ c.filtered_by }}</td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
      {% endif %}
    </details>
  </div>

  <!-- ============================== 8. FOOTER ============================== -->
  <div class="footer">
    <p><b>final_score</b> = {{ weights.valuation_z | fmt }} × valuation_z + {{ weights.catalyst_score | fmt }} × catalyst_score + {{ weights.ownership_quality_z | fmt }} × ownership_quality_z + {{ weights.low_vol_z | fmt }} × low_vol_z. Piotroski esigi: {{ weights.piotroski_normalized_score_threshold | fmt }}, ERP: %{{ weights.equity_risk_premium_pct | fmt }}. Bu agirliklar ve esikler DENENMEMIS BASLANGIC VARSAYIMLARIDIR; hicbir gecmis veriyle kalibre edilmemistir.</p>
    <p>DCF Referansi (deneysel, ana karara girmez) buyume senaryolari: dusuk %{{ weights.dcf_growth_low_pct | fmt }} / baz %{{ weights.dcf_growth_base_pct | fmt }} / yuksek %{{ weights.dcf_growth_high_pct | fmt }}, kurumlar vergisi orani %{{ weights.dcf_corporate_tax_rate_pct | fmt }}. Buyume senaryolari DENENMEMIS VARSAYIMDIR; kurumlar vergisi orani resmi/yasal orandir.</p>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    <p>{{ known_limitations_text }}</p>
    <p>{{ disclaimer_text }}</p>
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
